B.aFU=new A.fB("Fluxonium-Transmon-Fluxonium","Participated in the resarch, design and development of **Fluxonium-Transmon-Fluxonium (FTF)**-based Superconducting Qubits.With implementation of **Qiskit-Metal, Ansys HFSS, KQLayout, and QuTip** for quantum circuit development. My work focused on optimizing circuit parameters to enhance coherence and gate performance, contributing to advancements in superconducting qubit architectures.",u.E," Team-Lead, Remote Hackathon",null)
