B.aFP=new A.fB("Audio Editor(Trimmer, Merger)","As the developer of the **Audio Editor**, I built a comprehensive **Trimmer** and **Merger** system from scratch as a part for my **Undergrad Major Project**, focusing on the FrontEnd implementation. I successfully integrated **FFmpeg** for advanced audio manipulation capabilities including **trimming**, **merging**, and **extracting audio from video files**. The project was designed with the aim of developing an **open-source package** to be published on **pub.dev** for wider community use.","Flutter, ffmpeg","Personal Endeavor, Developer","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Hl3wFiGG7A8mf5cZshCe_mTiz_hoa7gY/view?usp=sharing")
B.aFR=new A.fB("ASKME.COM","ASKME.COM is an Udemy-style app featuring course booking, real-time doubt resolution, and seamless learning. It integrates **eSewa** for secure transactions, **WebSocket** for instant messaging, and **WebRTC** for high-quality voice/video calls, **Nudity** and **Profanity Filter**. The platform ensures smooth interaction between learners and instructors, enhancing the overall educational experience.","ESewa, WebRtc, WebSocket, Dio, Hive, tfLite","Flutter Tech Lead","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.askme.com")
B.aFT=new A.fB("Kaha Mobile","As a part-time Senior Developer at Masovision Technology (P) Ltd., I worked with the team on Kaha Mobile. I contributed to implementing **interceptors, Clean Architecture, Google Maps, and Google API integration**, ensuring a scalable and efficient application structure.","Google Maps, Google API","Senior Flutter Developer","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.kaha_hits.kaha&hl=en")
B.aFM=new A.fB("Geohash Locator","Implemented **dynamic map** interface enabling users to **navigate and explore** locations seamlessly. This project incorporates **real-time location tracking**, allowing users to **pinpoint their position** on the map. Additionally, it supports **custom markers to highlight specific points** of interest. To ensure efficient data storage and retrieval, the system is integrated with **Firebase**, providing a robust backend for managing **location-related** information.","Flutter Map, GeoHash, Firebase, Color Picker","Personal Endeavor","https://github.com/Risav25Pokhrel/GeoHash")
B.aFQ=new A.fB("Bhagavat Gita","As a personal endeavor, I developed a Bhagavad Gita mobile application with a focus on seamless offline access. The app follows an **Offline-First** approach, ensuring users can read without an internet connection. I implemented **DIO** Interceptors for efficient API handling, integrated **Text-to-Speech** for an immersive listening experience, and added a **Last Read Notifier** to help users resume from where they left off","Text To Speech,Dio, Hive, RiverPod ","Personal Endeavor","https://github.com/Risav25Pokhrel/Bhagavat-Gita")
B.aFW=new A.fB("Wordle",'As part of my personal endeavor, I conceptualized and developed a mobile application inspired by the popular web-based game "Wordle." This project involved building the game from scratch, adapting its mechanics. The implementation focused on intuitive gameplay, responsive design, and an engaging user interface to bring the classic word-guessing challenge to mobile users.',"Flutter, C/C++","Personal Endeavor","https://github.com/Risav25Pokhrel/Wordle_with_flutter")
